(43, 1, 5, 'Moto E4 Plus', 'XT1771', NULL, NULL, '2019-05-15 09:26:50', '2019-06-01 06:27:43'),
(44, 2, 6, 'LED View Cover N9', 'EF-NN960P', 'Fun and easy LED icons let you see notifications, caller ID, and other alerts without having to open the cover. Choose from a variety of preloaded icons, or customize your own.Keep an important card on hand with the interior card pocket.', NULL, '2019-05-15 11:31:19', '2019-06-17 04:57:03'),
(45, 2, 6, 'LED View Cover S10+', 'EF-NG975P', 'Check the time, missed calls, battery and more on the cover’s LED display -Keep your handset slim -Switch the screen on or off automatically when you open or close the case -High quality design with premium stitch effect', NULL, '2019-05-25 06:20:03', '2019-06-17 05:39:21'),
(46, 2, 6, 'Dual Layer Cover J6', 'EF-PJ600C', NULL, NULL, '2019-05-25 06:23:33', '2019-05-25 06:23:33'),
(47, 3, 6, 'Travel Adapter', 'EP-TA12EB', NULL, NULL, '2019-05-26 05:54:34', '2019-05-26 06:21:05'),
(48, 1, 2, 'Test Product', 'ABC123', 'This Product is very good.', '15592019041268111815.jpg', '2019-05-30 07:38:24', '2019-05-30 07:38:24'),
(49, 2, 6, 'LEATHER WALLET COVER N9', 'EF-WN960L', 'Elegant protection against impact, scratches and other damage Integrated compartment for business Cards Wake-up function - switches device on / off when opening / closing the display cover.', NULL, '2019-06-01 09:17:49', '2019-06-01 10:25:30'),
(50, 2, 6, 'Dual Layer Cover A6+', 'EF-PA605C', 'Protect your smartphone without attracting attention. The Dual Layer Cover has been designed to offer maximum protection. Its outer shell is responsible for protecting your smartphone from shock, while its interior in softer thermoplastic material is perfect for absorbing impacts. Double protection, double tranquility.', NULL, '2019-06-01 09:32:06', '2019-06-01 10:25:53'),
(52, 5, 2, 'In-Earphone AM115', 'AM115', 'Huawei Stereo Earphones With Remote And Microphone Crystal Clear Audio. Huawei Earphones AM115 Multiple vent holes for a high- fidelity music and call experience.', '15600812381562637315.jpg', '2019-06-09 11:53:59', '2019-06-15 06:28:07'),
(53, 5, 2, 'In-Earphone AM116', 'AM116', 'AM116 Half In-Ear Headphones with Remote Wire Control and Microphone Foldable Lightweight Earbuds Crystal Clear Audio.Huawei –AM116 In-earphone. Style, In-ear. Function, microphone, Song switch, Volume control. Color, White/Black. Headphone Jack, •3.5mm with Metal body.', '15601391561634432488.jpg', '2019-06-10 03:59:16', '2019-06-15 06:28:33'),
(54, 5, 2, 'Free Buds-CMH1', 'CMH1', 'The HUAWEI TRUE WIRELESS FREEBUDS CMH1 will impress with its amazing features & capabilities.After a simple Bluetooth® pairing, they will connect automatically once you open the case; you can listen to music or make phone calls when wearing them.', '1560139455978637582.jpg', '2019-06-10 04:04:15', '2019-06-15 06:30:01'),
(55, 5, 2, 'Sport BT Headphone AM61', 'AM61', 'Huawei Sport Bluetooth Earphones: enjoy 11 hours continuous playback with 137 mAh lithium battery . Original Honor Xsport Bluetooth Earphones AM61 IPX5 Waterproof ... Bluetooth Earphone,Sport Earbuds With magnetic absorption, you are easily store it while not using.', '15601400168929867.jpg', '2019-06-10 04:13:36', '2019-06-15 06:30:24'),
(56, 7, 2, 'Portable BT Speaker CM51', 'CM51', 'HUAWEI SoundStone Portable Bluetooth Speaker features wireless, water resistant and portable mine size design, delivers loud and clear sound.', '1560140237694036833.jpg', '2019-06-10 04:17:17', '2019-07-08 09:27:16'),
(57, 11, 2, 'Watch GT-Fortuna', 'Fortuna-B19S', 'HUAWEI WATCH GT is a revolutionary long-battery life outdoor smartwatch, which features slim design, precise GPS, TruSleep™ monitoring,', '1560140619245222880.jpg', '2019-06-10 04:23:39', '2019-06-15 06:32:32'),
(58, 11, 2, 'TalkBand B3e Lite', 'B3e Lite', 'The Huawei TalkBand B3 Lite Smart Watch is a two in one combo. It can either be a smart watch or transform into headset that allows you to receive your calls.HUAWEI TalkBand B3 Lite Smartband with pedometer, phone finder and intelligent audio enhancement, you\'ll hear and be heard with perfect clarity.', '15601410291477542905.jpg', '2019-06-10 04:30:29', '2019-06-15 06:33:00'),
(59, 11, 2, 'Huawei Band 3e', 'AW70', 'Huawei AW70-B29 Band 3e Smart Watch Band Body: 40.5mm*14.8mm*11.2mm Wristband: 226.15mm*17.4mm Weigh.', '15601415801245214904.jpg', '2019-06-10 04:39:40', '2019-06-15 06:33:33'),
(60, 3, 2, 'Wireless Charger', 'CP60', 'Official Huawei 15W Quick Wireless Charger. ... 15W (Max) Quick Wireless Charge, allows you to enjoy wired charging speed, wirelessly. Built-in chip can adjust the output power automatically according to the ambient temperature and real-time battery percentage.', '1560142544427590163.jpg', '2019-06-10 04:55:44', '2019-06-15 06:34:00'),
(61, 1, 2, 'Y-5 2019', 'Y-5 2019', 'Experience more with the large Dewdrop display and the custom Faux-Leather design on the HUAWEI Y5 2019.', '1560144109580506695.jpg', '2019-06-10 05:21:49', '2019-06-10 05:21:49'),
(62, 10, 2, 'Y-Max', 'Y-Max', 'HUAWEI Y MAX features the most advanced Dolby Atmos® sound system, 7.12\'\' FullView Display screen, 5000 mAh large battery and Master AI camera.', '15601493431398094454.jpg', '2019-06-10 06:49:03', '2019-06-10 06:49:03'),
(63, 10, 2, 'Media Pad T3-7', 'T3-7', 'HUAWEI MediaPad T3 7 inch tablet. This powerful device will surprise and delight you with its form and function for every family member, and with smart app access can make it a kid\'s tablet.', '15601502571497592019.jpeg', '2019-06-10 07:04:17', '2019-06-15 06:34:22'),
(64, 10, 2, 'Media Pad T3-8', 'T3-8', 'See the world in crisp and vivid colour with the HUAWEI MediaPad T3 8-inch IPS HD Display. This high resolution display will bring your watching experience.Too many a tablet is an entertainment device and too many it is a work station.', '1560150659102721106.jpg', '2019-06-10 07:10:59', '2019-06-15 06:34:39'),
(65, 10, 2, 'Media Pad T3-10', 'T3-10', 'The tablet comes with a 9.60-inch display with a resolution of 800x1280 pixels. Huawei MediaPad T3 10 is powered by a 1.4GHz quad-core Qualcomm Snapdragon 425 processor. It comes with 2GB of RAM. The Huawei MediaPad T3 10 runs Android 7.0 and is powered by a 4,800mAh non-removable battery.', '156015082032685353.jpg', '2019-06-10 07:13:40', '2019-06-15 06:34:58'),
(66, 3, 2, 'AP32-Type-B', 'AP32-Type-B', 'With this original Huawei wall charger, you will never suffer about low battery again! Recharge your Huawei USB Type-C device at astonishing speeds with this Huawei AP32 quick wall charger. Featuring Quick Charge technology and 2A of output power this travel charger is up to 3 times faster than regular chargers.', '15666475231099446800.jpg', '2019-08-24 11:52:03', '2019-08-24 11:52:03'),
(67, 3, 2, 'AP32-Type-C', 'AP32-Type-C', 'With this original Huawei wall charger, you will never suffer about low battery again! Recharge your Huawei USB Type-C device at astonishing speeds with this Huawei AP32 quick wall charger. Featuring Quick Charge technology and 2A of output power this travel charger is up to 3 times faster than regular chargers.', '15666475681643624472.jpg', '2019-08-24 11:52:48', '2019-08-24 11:52:48'),
(68, 6, 2, 'Power Bank-CP11QC', 'CP11QC', 'CP11QC is 10,000 mAh (Max 18W) fast charge edition mobile power banks that support bidirectional fast charging.', '1566647631734496047.jpg', '2019-08-24 11:53:51', '2019-08-24 11:53:51'),
(69, 3, 2, 'ADAPTER-CP84', 'HW-100400EOU', 'Official Huawei SuperCharge USB-C Charger, Max 40 W, Mains Powered USB-C Super Fast Phone Charger for Huawei Smartphones and Devices', '1566648019308989001.jpg', '2019-08-24 12:00:19', '2019-08-24 12:00:19');
